title: Law and the Family
subtitle: Justice: civil marriage and divorce, equal rights of women.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'family_law') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.family_law. Opening and closing the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action. Z — 1.00 (the
// sketch and the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026, 3: the equal rights of women gain the intelligentsia and democracy).
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'family_law');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_family');
!}

= Law and the family

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

Each part of the country has a different civil law, and marriages and divorces are mostly decided by the Churches. One modern law is an old demand of the left.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @civil_marriage
- @women_rights
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@civil_marriage
title: Introduce civil marriage and divorce
subtitle: No cost to the budget. Workers and the intelligentsia trust PPS more (+3), but the Christian Democrats and the Church protest, and our relations with the Christian Democrats worsen (−8). [? if pl_family_law_civil_marriage_coalition : [+ pl_family_law_civil_marriage_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'family_law', 'civil_marriage').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_family_law_civil_marriage_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'family_law', 'civil_marriage');
!}
go-to: result

@women_rights
title: Give women equal rights in civil law
subtitle: No cost to the budget. The intelligentsia trusts PPS more (+2) and democracy grows stronger (+1), but the Christian Democrats protest (−5). [? if pl_family_law_women_rights_coalition : [+ pl_family_law_women_rights_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'family_law', 'women_rights').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_family_law_women_rights_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'family_law', 'women_rights');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

